2. उत्कण्ठ Nom. Ā. उत्कण्ठते, to raise the neck;
to long for, regret, sorrow for, R.; Śiś.; Bhaṭṭ. &c.:
Caus. उत्कण्ठयति, to cause any one to lift up the neck;
to excite longing, inspire with tender emotions, Bhartṛ.; Kāvyād. &c.

उत्-√ कम्प् (उद्-√ कम्प्) Ā. -कम्पते, to tremble, shudder, Kathās.; Gīt. :
Caus. P. -कम्पयति, to cause to tremble;
to shake up, rouse;
to agitate, ŚBr.; KātyŚr.

उत्-कलापय (said to be a Caus. fr. उद्-√ कल् above), Nom. P. -कलापयति, to take leave of, bid farewell, Pañcat.;
to bring one's wife home from her father's house;
to marry, Vet.

उत्-कुच् (उद्-√ कुच्), -कुचति, to bend upwards or asunder, crook, Kauś.;
to open (as a flower) :
Caus. -कोचयति, to cause to bend or to open (e.g. a flower).

उत्-√ कॄ (उद्-√ कॄ) P. -किरति, to scatter upwards;
to pile up, heap up, Ragh.; R.;
to dig up or out, excavate, VS.; ŚBr.; KātyŚr.; MBh.; Suśr. &c.;
to engrave, Vikr.; Ragh.

1. उत्-√ कृत् (उद्-√ कृत्) P. -कृन्तति, to cut out or off, tear out or off;
to cut up, cut in pieces, carve, butcher, ŚBr.; Mn.; Yājñ.; MBh.; Ragh. &c.;
to destroy, ruin, extirpate:
Pass. -कृत्यते, to perish, AitBr. vi, 23, 7.

उत्-√ कृष् (उद्-√ कृष्) P. sometimes Ā. -कर्षति, -ते, to draw or drag or pull up;
to raise;
to draw or take out;
to extract;
to pull or put off, MāṇḍUp.; MBh.; Ragh.; Suśr.; R. &c.;
to put off, delay, Nyāyam.;
to bend (a bow);
to tear asunder:
Caus. -कर्षयति, to elevate, raise, increase, Sāh. :
Pass. -कृष्यते, to be lifted or drawn up;
to be raised, rise, become powerful, become eminent, MBh. &c. (cf. उत्-कृष्ट).

उत्-√ क्रम् (उद्-√ क्रम्) P. (and rarely Ā.) -क्रामति, -क्रमति (Ved. impf. 3. pl. -अक्रमन्, AV. iv, 3, 1), -ते (pf. 3. pl. -चक्रमुस्, ŚBr.) to step up, go up, ascend, AV.; VS.; TS.; ŚBr.; KātyŚr.; R.; Kathās. &c.;
to step out, go out or away;
to pass away, die, ŚBr.; Mn.; Nir.; Kād. &c.;
to go over, pass over, omit;
 not to notice;
to neglect, transgress, MBh.; R. &c.:
Caus. P. -क्रमयति and -क्रामयति, to cause to go up or ascend, TS.; ŚBr.; Kauś. &c.:
Desid. -चिक्रमिषति, or -चिक्रमिष्यति, to wish to go up or out, ŚBr.; ChUp.

उत्-√ क्रुश् (उद्-√ क्रुश्) P. -क्रोशति, to cry out, scream, MBh.; R.; MārkP.;
to call to (with acc.), MBh.;
to exclaim;
to proclaims, W.

उत्-√ क्लिश् (उद्-√ क्लिश्) P. -क्लिश्नाति, to feel uneasy, be uncomfortable or distressed:
Caus. P. -क्लेशयति, to excite, stir up, Suśr.;
to expel.
